test version and it looks good, great job!\n\nThere are some remaining UX polishes, but we can tackle those in follow-up PRs: \n- The `Donate` button should be surfaced in the project manager when it's in portrait mode and the side bar is gone.\n- The `Asset Store` section is cut-off when in offline mode. It updates its layout to fit when online mode is restored. \n  - Same for the `Debugger` bottom panel\n\n![Screenshot_20260810-141153.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cceda373-b173-4283-a838-06cf6f783c34)\n\n![Screenshot_20260810-141203.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef9e426c-0bdf-4b50-b9a1-9b0b1e86ac12)\n\n\n\n\n- The embedded game pre-launch window still has a landscape aspect ratio, but when launching the game, the actual embedded game window opens with a portrait aspect ratio.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/786fd93d-a430-48a1-b06e-62f358fc435f\n\n\n\nThis PR should be good to go once the remaining feedback is addressed.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121892#pullrequestreview-4901081606","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121892","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-10T21:25:30Z"},{"id":4913772872,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJOI5SA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"2b63c661a38e998199ffd187012c58b80e397000","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?u=25817fe797fcc7a812ba9d7f58f593f5a003abbb&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121892#pullrequestreview-4913772872","pull_request_url